Little Bean pregnancy food-safety alerts feed
Copyright (c) 2026 Little Bean (https://github.com/Mbr0/little-bean)

public/alerts.json is licensed under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE). Each record is
derived from an official food recall or alert published by one of the public
bodies below. Recall titles and descriptions are reproduced verbatim in the
original language of the notice, and every record links back to the official
notice in its "url" field. The "source" field of each record names the
regulator it came from.

The sources were identified from the "source", "id", "url" and "countries"
fields of public/alerts.json and cross-checked against the fetcher in the
main repository (scripts/fetch-alerts.ts in Mbr0/little-bean). Licence
statements were last reviewed on 2026-09-25. Where a licence could not be
confirmed, this is stated under "Uncertain" below. If you reuse this data,
check the current terms of the source you rely on.

