4. NVWA (Netherlands)                                             source: "NVWA"
================================================================================
Producer:  Nederlandse Voedsel- en Warenautoriteit (NVWA, Netherlands Food and
           Consumer Product Safety Authority)
Dataset:   Product warnings ("waarschuwingen") published on www.nvwa.nl,
           discovered through the site's sitemap (https://www.nvwa.nl/sitemap.xml).
           This is website content, not a published open dataset.
Licence:   Uncertain. Dutch central-government websites generally place their
           content under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication); this has not been
           confirmed for nvwa.nl specifically; check the copyright statement
           on www.nvwa.nl before relying on it.
Attribution:
           Source: Nederlandse Voedsel- en Warenautoriteit (NVWA), www.nvwa.nl.

